{
  "$comment": [
    "The translation table behind contracts/tailwind.css. One Tailwind v4 theme key per",
    "contract token that should mint a utility, in the order the @theme inline block emits.",
    "",
    "This is data and not code because the names differ on purpose: --color-surface reads",
    "--token-bg-raised and --color-ink reads --token-text. A rule could not produce that; a",
    "table can, and a table is reviewable line by line.",
    "",
    "It sits beside tokens/ rather than inside it because the Style Dictionary source glob is",
    "tokens/*.json, and a map file in that directory would be read as tokens.",
    "",
    "packages/tokens/build.mjs refuses a key in a namespace Tailwind v4 does not theme, a key",
    "and a token that are the same name (AD-14: a cycle that resolves to transparent), a",
    "reference to the raw --c-* palette, a token the dictionary does not publish, a duplicate",
    "key and an empty map. What is deliberately left out, and why, is recorded in",
    "ops/tailwind-adapter.md."
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "colour: Tailwind --color-* from our --token-* roles",
      "entries": [
        { "key": "--color-bg", "token": "--token-bg" },
        { "key": "--color-surface", "token": "--token-bg-raised" },
        { "key": "--color-surface-2", "token": "--token-bg-raised-2" },
